rization times differ. Order differs from content; first, next, previous and later retain their source meanings.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"context_only_spans\":[{\"alias\":\"sffff\",\"text\":\"CONTEXT ONLY: CLM-NEIGHBOR reports 900 units (REF-9999). The recording date is 2040-01-01.\"}],\"production_contract\":\"semantic-task-v1\",\"required_refs\":[\"REF-20180\",\"REF-20181\",\"REF-20182\"],\"role\":\"producer\",\"routed_rules\":[],\"source_spans\":[{\"alias\":\"s0\",\"text\":\"Clinical dossier / segment 1\\nPhase 01 | CLM-A: The synthetic ward planned 11 specimens (REF-20180).\\nPhase 02 | CLM-B: The synthetic ward reported 14 specimens (REF-20181).\\nPhase 03 | CLM-C: The synthetic ward reported 29 specimens for the same entry as CLM-B (REF-20182).\\nPhase 04 | The recording date is unavailable.\\nPhase 05 | The first entry recording date is missing.\"}],\"supplied_refs\":[\"REF-20180\",\"REF-20181\",\"REF-20182\",\"REF-9999\"]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n",
